#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""locachy-firmware: backend helper for LOCachy's /usr/local/bin/firmware TUI.

Provides structured TSV queries and safe execution wrappers around:
  1. fwupd (fwupdmgr --json): devices, releases (upgrade/downgrade/reinstall),
     LVFS remotes, metadata refresh, local .cab install, verify, unlock.
  2. Firmware attributes (/sys/class/firmware-attributes/* such as ThinkPad
     think-lmi, Dell/HP/Framework BIOS attributes, with fwupdmgr fallback):
     listing and modifying BIOS Setup settings from Linux.
  3. flashrom: programmer detection (internal + USB programmers such as
     CH341A / FT2232 / Dediprog), Intel iTCO_wdt unload/restore guard, chip &
     IFD region probing, mandatory 3-read SHA-256 verified backup, verify,
     and size/AC-checked write.
"""
